WEBVTT

00:00:05.264 --> 00:00:07.374
I want to love you more

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.674
I want to give you more love

00:00:09.674 --> 00:00:15.414
I just want to hear your voice

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:29.094
MAGIKANO

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:35.134
As I soaked my fruit corn flakes in milk

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:39.834
I thought about it with bedhair

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:45.774
In front of the railroad crossing

00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:51.144
You suddenly covered your ears and stopped

00:00:52.144 --> 00:00:54.814
But listen! I want you more

00:00:54.814 --> 00:00:56.354
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:00:56.354 --> 00:00:59.384
I want to give you more kisses

00:00:59.384 --> 00:01:03.394
I get a little lonely for some reason

00:01:03.394 --> 00:01:05.294
To tell you the truth

00:01:05.294 --> 00:01:06.964
I want to give you more love

00:01:06.964 --> 00:01:08.464
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:13.364
So keep your spirits higher

00:01:14.504 --> 00:01:20.514
Your smile is enough to give me a fever

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:25.774
The fever of happiness is rising

00:01:40.594 --> 00:01:41.994
I'm home...

00:01:42.764 --> 00:01:43.764
Haruo!

00:01:43.764 --> 00:01:45.004
Big Brother!

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.524
About Christmas Eve tomorrow...
About Christmas Eve tomorrow...

00:01:48.534 --> 00:01:51.904
Sorry, I'm exhausted today, so...

00:01:55.644 --> 00:01:57.984
He's going to spend time with ME tomorrow!

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.504
No, with ME!

00:02:00.214 --> 00:02:02.254
That will NEVER happen!
Of course it's ME who's going to be with him!

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:05.054
Impossible! He spends Christmas Eve
with me EVERY YEAR!

00:02:05.054 --> 00:02:07.524
What are they arguing about?

00:02:07.524 --> 00:02:10.294
Probably because it's Christmas Eve tomorrow.

00:02:10.294 --> 00:02:11.624
Ah, I see!

00:02:11.624 --> 00:02:15.224
They're arguing about who's going to
get how much of the roast turkey, right?

00:02:15.464 --> 00:02:20.694
Jeez, to Chiaki, Christmas is just a day
she gets to eat a big meal...

00:02:32.144 --> 00:02:34.654
Today is the 23rd...

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:36.714
Just one more day...

00:02:37.284 --> 00:02:42.224
Episode 11
Magi? It's a Holy Night?

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:56.734
Merry Christmas!

00:02:58.144 --> 00:02:59.364
Kurosu!

00:03:07.614 --> 00:03:11.384
It's Christmas day, a special day.
Don't call me by my last name.

00:03:11.384 --> 00:03:12.984
R-Right...

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:15.524
I'm sorry, Yuri...

00:03:15.524 --> 00:03:20.554
I didn't know it was going to be this kind of setting,
so I didn't even bring a present...

00:03:21.194 --> 00:03:25.064
Just you coming here is the best present for me.

00:03:25.064 --> 00:03:28.264
Besides, the present that I got for you is...

00:03:31.404 --> 00:03:34.134
MYSELF!

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:35.934
Yuri...

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:39.944
Look how adorable you are...

00:03:39.944 --> 00:03:43.744
I'm enslaved by your cuteness, Yuttan.

00:03:46.524 --> 00:03:49.254
Miss President! Miss Yuri!

00:03:49.894 --> 00:03:53.264
If you're tired, should we go ahead
and stop now for today?

00:03:53.264 --> 00:03:56.164
N-No! I'm gonna go splash some water on my face!

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:00.064
Women's Restroom

00:04:00.934 --> 00:04:05.464
No, no! I can't believe I imagined
such indecent things!

00:04:11.714 --> 00:04:14.284
Today is Christmas Eve!

00:04:14.284 --> 00:04:16.654
I must thank the Holy Being, Senior Yoshikawa,

00:04:16.654 --> 00:04:20.584
for keeping the evil witch under control
on a daily basis!

00:04:37.074 --> 00:04:41.704
Lord, I thank you for this holy night.

00:04:43.744 --> 00:04:47.184
This world is now being ruled by witches!

00:04:47.184 --> 00:04:50.284
Resistance is futile!

00:04:50.284 --> 00:04:54.324
We'll feed the people in this world magically infused
lunches and bring them under our control!

00:04:54.324 --> 00:04:55.524
There you are, you evil witches!

00:04:55.524 --> 00:04:58.524
Let's go! I'm going to borrow the power of my
glasses and commence my deadly technique,

00:04:58.524 --> 00:04:59.654
Haruo Attack!

00:05:04.434 --> 00:05:06.804
Flash blast!

00:05:06.804 --> 00:05:09.534
Holy Spear!

00:05:15.314 --> 00:05:17.314
Oh, you holy being, Senior Yoshikawa!

00:05:17.314 --> 00:05:19.874
Now the peace of the world has been saved!

00:05:20.044 --> 00:05:23.454
Yeah. Look at that, the holy dawn.

00:05:42.234 --> 00:05:44.344
Today is Christmas Eve!

00:05:44.344 --> 00:05:48.744
I'm going to cook up my special dishes
just for my brother!

00:06:02.624 --> 00:06:05.094
Whoa!

00:06:11.234 --> 00:06:13.864
Big Brother, eat as much as you want, okay?

00:06:14.274 --> 00:06:17.364
Yeah, I will! Thank you for the food!

00:06:23.074 --> 00:06:24.984
Ah, that was delicious!

00:06:24.984 --> 00:06:27.954
Your cooking is the best in the world, Maika!

00:06:27.954 --> 00:06:30.884
Big Brother, you have a grain of rice on your cheek!

00:06:32.954 --> 00:06:34.554
Thanks.

00:06:34.554 --> 00:06:36.194
Now it's my turn to thank you!

00:06:36.194 --> 00:06:37.214
Smooch!

00:06:37.794 --> 00:06:39.864
Good girl, good girl, good girl!

00:06:39.864 --> 00:06:42.724
I'm in bliss!

00:06:43.864 --> 00:06:45.834
Big Brother...

00:06:46.834 --> 00:06:48.394
What's up, Haruo?

00:06:53.144 --> 00:06:58.374
Hey, dude, you don't look so good.
What's wrong with you?

00:06:59.214 --> 00:07:02.114
And, besides, you haven't hung out
with us at all lately!

00:07:02.514 --> 00:07:05.384
Oh... I'm just going through a lot...

00:07:06.624 --> 00:07:08.324
At times like that, you need THIS!

00:07:08.324 --> 00:07:10.394
It's a super magnet that
I purchased through the mail!

00:07:10.394 --> 00:07:11.724
Get Well Soon D!

00:07:11.724 --> 00:07:12.164
Big Brother!
Yoshikawa!
Senior Yoshikawa!

00:07:12.164 --> 00:07:13.324
Write me, okay?!

00:07:13.324 --> 00:07:14.594
Ho! Ho! Ho! Ho!
Write me, okay?!

00:07:14.594 --> 00:07:16.034
Ho! Ho! Ho! Ho!

00:07:16.264 --> 00:07:18.634
Big Brother, about tonight...

00:07:18.634 --> 00:07:20.634
If you don't mind...

00:07:20.634 --> 00:07:23.104
Would you spend some time with me?

00:07:24.144 --> 00:07:27.664
I'm sorry, but I have to go take care of something.

00:07:29.674 --> 00:07:31.114
I'd better get going.

00:07:31.244 --> 00:07:32.344
Big Brother...

00:07:32.344 --> 00:07:33.114
Yoshikawa!
Big Brother...

00:07:33.114 --> 00:07:33.414
Yoshikawa!
Senior...

00:07:33.414 --> 00:07:34.404
Senior...

00:07:36.754 --> 00:07:42.154
Hmph! It seems like everyone's trying to spend
Christmas Eve with Haruo, but it's no use!

00:07:42.724 --> 00:07:43.884
Lady Ayumi.

00:07:45.724 --> 00:07:49.494
Aren't you going to do anything, Lady Ayumi?

00:07:49.494 --> 00:07:51.434
What are you talking about?

00:07:51.434 --> 00:07:56.174
I am Sakuramori Academy's No. 1 girl
that everyone desires

00:07:56.174 --> 00:07:59.104
and wants to spend this monumental
once-in-a-year holy night with!

00:07:59.104 --> 00:08:02.774
So why would I be the one to make
the first move?! Hmph!

00:08:03.244 --> 00:08:05.844
But Master Haruo has already left.

00:08:10.314 --> 00:08:12.584
Oh, that silly Haruo!

00:08:12.584 --> 00:08:15.114
He must not have noticed that I was here!

00:08:18.424 --> 00:08:20.364
I'm gonna beat him to it!

00:08:25.604 --> 00:08:29.794
CHRISTMAS SALE

00:08:34.844 --> 00:08:35.774
Haruo!

00:08:36.344 --> 00:08:38.214
M-Mamiya!

00:08:39.414 --> 00:08:42.254
Don't you have anything to say to me?

00:08:42.254 --> 00:08:44.444
N-Not at all!

00:08:45.024 --> 00:08:47.594
Sorry, but I'm in a hurry, so...

00:08:47.594 --> 00:08:48.824
Hey, hold it right there!

00:08:48.824 --> 00:08:50.324
I'm not done talking to you yet!

00:08:50.324 --> 00:08:51.924
Let me go!

00:08:51.924 --> 00:08:53.954
Owww!

00:08:54.664 --> 00:08:56.564
I-I'm so sorry!

00:08:56.994 --> 00:09:00.124
Um, I'm in a hurry, so I gotta go!

00:09:00.574 --> 00:09:02.264
H-Haruo!

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:19.944
Lady Ayumi.

00:09:20.054 --> 00:09:21.314
Rika?

00:09:21.494 --> 00:09:23.114
Do you see that store?

00:09:32.464 --> 00:09:36.424
It seems that Master Haruo has been
working here part-time.

00:09:36.774 --> 00:09:37.904
I see!

00:09:37.904 --> 00:09:43.404
He must've been working a part-time job without
telling me so he can buy me an expensive present!

00:09:43.474 --> 00:09:44.984
But I almost ruined his secret,

00:09:44.984 --> 00:09:47.144
and that must be why he treated me
the way he did earlier!

00:09:54.354 --> 00:09:55.514
What...

00:10:42.634 --> 00:10:44.164
Lady Ayumi.

00:10:44.844 --> 00:10:46.304
Just don't mind me.

00:10:46.304 --> 00:10:47.144
But...

00:10:47.144 --> 00:10:48.734
Leave me alone...

00:10:49.574 --> 00:10:51.674
I said LEAVE ME ALONE!

00:11:05.024 --> 00:11:07.124
This has to be some kind of mistake.

00:11:07.124 --> 00:11:10.934
Haruo would never ignore me and
flirt with some other girl!

00:11:10.934 --> 00:11:13.694
This is definitely some kind of mistake!

00:12:00.314 --> 00:12:01.214
HMPH!

00:12:01.984 --> 00:12:06.114
Haruo, how dare you keep me waiting this long?!

00:12:06.454 --> 00:12:10.084
I will not forgive you if it turns out
to be some lame ass present!

00:12:11.924 --> 00:12:15.864
I can just picture Haruo's face
when he finds me out here!

00:12:15.864 --> 00:12:18.764
That's right! There's NOTHING
going on between him and that girl!

00:12:18.764 --> 00:12:19.664
Huh?

00:12:20.464 --> 00:12:22.524
All right, let's go find some presents!

00:12:23.274 --> 00:12:24.104
Sure!

00:12:24.104 --> 00:12:26.074
Oh, Ran, you're gonna get wet.

00:12:26.074 --> 00:12:27.404
Thanks.

00:12:27.974 --> 00:12:29.034
What?

00:12:30.474 --> 00:12:32.914
It's freezing cold, isn't it?

00:12:32.914 --> 00:12:34.614
Look, my breath is white.

00:12:43.294 --> 00:12:45.784
Thanks to her, I found really good ones.

00:12:49.564 --> 00:12:50.794
I'm home!

00:12:51.364 --> 00:12:53.304
Huh? Is there a blackout?

00:12:55.274 --> 00:12:57.794
Big Brother!
Big Bro!
Big Brother Haruo!

00:12:58.704 --> 00:13:00.604
That's my Big Brother!

00:13:00.604 --> 00:13:04.714
I was so worried about if we were going to
have a Christmas party or not this year!

00:13:04.714 --> 00:13:07.684
But actually I got your invitation from Rika today!

00:13:07.684 --> 00:13:09.784
That was such a surprise!

00:13:09.784 --> 00:13:13.884
All you can eat chicken! All you can eat cake!
And all you can drink juice and protein drinks!

00:13:13.884 --> 00:13:15.294
It doesn't get better than this!

00:13:15.294 --> 00:13:19.594
Not only that, all the chocolates shaped like
gold coins and cookies shaped like gold bars!

00:13:19.594 --> 00:13:20.924
I'm so happy!

00:13:22.094 --> 00:13:25.564
Good, I've been secretly working part-time
so I could do this for you guys.

00:13:25.564 --> 00:13:28.404
The cost of the food ingredients
was more than I expected,

00:13:28.404 --> 00:13:31.674
so I had to work until today to make enough
money to cover everyone's presents!

00:13:31.674 --> 00:13:34.834
So that's why you've been coming home late lately!

00:13:35.344 --> 00:13:38.674
Everyone, I finished baking the Christmas cake.

00:13:41.314 --> 00:13:43.844
Rika, you made one amazing looking cake,
you know that?

00:13:46.754 --> 00:13:48.494
Merry Christmas!

00:13:48.494 --> 00:13:53.324
Senior Yoshikawa, thank you so much for
inviting me to your Christmas party!

00:13:54.094 --> 00:13:55.764
You don't have to be
so formal with me, Yoshikawa.

00:13:55.764 --> 00:13:58.424
You should've just mentioned this to me at school.

00:13:58.734 --> 00:14:02.694
To be honest, it would've been much nicer
if this party was just for two of us...

00:14:03.104 --> 00:14:04.204
Come on in!

00:14:04.204 --> 00:14:05.404
Thanks.

00:14:05.404 --> 00:14:08.244
Wow! Look at that cake!

00:14:08.644 --> 00:14:13.014
I've never eaten a cake that's not
sliced into wedges before!

00:14:13.214 --> 00:14:18.204
Lord, you must have granted a reward to me,
who purifies the darkness and adheres to Justice!

00:14:18.754 --> 00:14:23.784
Rika, thank you for making sure everyone
got the party invitation.

00:14:24.054 --> 00:14:25.024
My pleasure.

00:14:25.024 --> 00:14:28.584
However, I just couldn't locate Lady Ayumi...

00:14:28.894 --> 00:14:29.924
What?

00:14:31.904 --> 00:14:33.594
Owww!

00:14:34.604 --> 00:14:35.934
Could it be...

00:14:37.504 --> 00:14:40.444
Kurosu, give these presents to everyone!

00:14:40.444 --> 00:14:42.644
Huh? Hey, Yoshikawa!
Where do you think you're going?

00:14:42.644 --> 00:14:44.344
Senior Yoshikawa!

00:14:44.614 --> 00:14:47.014
Big Brother! It's snowing outside!

00:14:47.014 --> 00:14:48.714
Aren't we gonna eat?

00:14:49.654 --> 00:14:54.614
CHRISTMAS SALE

00:14:55.354 --> 00:14:58.194
Mamiya! Mamiya!

00:14:58.294 --> 00:14:59.624
Mamiya!

00:15:00.194 --> 00:15:01.564
Mamiya!

00:15:05.134 --> 00:15:07.134
Mamiya! Where are you?

00:15:07.134 --> 00:15:08.564
Mamiya!

00:15:10.304 --> 00:15:12.244
I'm starving...

00:15:12.244 --> 00:15:14.764
I want to eat this cake!

00:15:15.074 --> 00:15:18.104
No! We have to wait till my brother comes home!

00:15:22.254 --> 00:15:25.044
Mamiya! Mamiya!

00:15:43.034 --> 00:15:44.444
That foie gras was pretty big, huh?

00:15:44.444 --> 00:15:46.344
Yeah, I couldn't believe it!

00:15:46.504 --> 00:15:48.344
That was delicious.

00:15:48.344 --> 00:15:50.034
Thank you for the dinner, Shinichi.

00:15:50.244 --> 00:15:53.774
No problem! I have to spend some money
on Christmas dinner, right?

00:15:54.214 --> 00:15:56.084
What? Were they on a date?

00:15:56.514 --> 00:15:58.574
So that means Haruo wasn't...

00:16:00.084 --> 00:16:03.924
Are you Miss Ayumi Mamiya by any chance?

00:16:03.994 --> 00:16:06.894
Huh? How do you know my name?

00:16:07.464 --> 00:16:11.134
I thought so! You're just like how he described!

00:16:11.134 --> 00:16:13.164
So did you like the present?

00:16:13.164 --> 00:16:14.134
Huh?

00:16:14.774 --> 00:16:19.934
Haruo asked me to go shopping with him
because he didn't know what to pick out for girls!

00:16:20.174 --> 00:16:24.334
In my opinion, I did my best to pick them,
but what did you think?

00:16:25.944 --> 00:16:28.214
All right, let's go find some presents!

00:16:28.884 --> 00:16:31.424
Sure! Oh, Ran, you're gonna get wet.

00:16:31.424 --> 00:16:32.644
Thanks.

00:16:35.154 --> 00:16:36.984
Hey, wait!

00:16:42.634 --> 00:16:44.804
Hmm, it's past 10 o'clock.

00:16:44.804 --> 00:16:47.794
Oh well, why don't we at least
pass out the presents?

00:16:49.574 --> 00:16:53.134
Let's see... This is for Maika... Chiaki...

00:16:54.914 --> 00:16:57.074
Next is Fuyuno and Nijihara!

00:17:06.384 --> 00:17:11.024
Hmph! See! I knew I was right!

00:17:11.024 --> 00:17:13.854
Haruo was buying me a present after all!

00:17:16.994 --> 00:17:19.864
Wow! I got a bracelet!

00:17:23.534 --> 00:17:25.474
Here, this is for you, Rika.

00:17:25.474 --> 00:17:27.504
And this one is for me.

00:17:27.504 --> 00:17:29.204
Is there anything else...

00:17:29.974 --> 00:17:31.534
I'M HOME!

00:17:32.614 --> 00:17:34.954
Hey, is that a Christmas present from Haruo?!

00:17:34.954 --> 00:17:36.454
So you got one, too, huh, Rika?

00:17:36.454 --> 00:17:37.614
Where's mine?

00:17:39.424 --> 00:17:40.754
Mamiya...

00:17:43.094 --> 00:17:45.654
Huh? Empty?

00:17:46.024 --> 00:17:50.624
Yuri, um, where's the present for Ayumi?

00:17:51.164 --> 00:17:55.694
Well, actually I didn't see a present for Mamiya...

00:18:08.084 --> 00:18:12.454
Oh, okay, I see.

00:18:12.454 --> 00:18:14.824
Everyone got one but me, right?

00:18:15.094 --> 00:18:16.384
That's not true!

00:18:17.764 --> 00:18:19.694
That's not true, Mamiya!

00:18:20.264 --> 00:18:21.324
Haruo...

00:18:21.964 --> 00:18:25.164
What's not true? Don't worry about it.

00:18:25.164 --> 00:18:28.434
I don't need a present from you anyway.

00:18:29.804 --> 00:18:33.004
No, that's not what I was talking about! Mamiya!

00:18:36.914 --> 00:18:38.504
Oww!

00:18:38.614 --> 00:18:40.244
Are you okay? Mamiya!

00:18:40.244 --> 00:18:41.614
Let me go!

00:18:41.614 --> 00:18:43.484
No! I won't!

00:18:44.054 --> 00:18:46.254
I hate you!

00:18:46.254 --> 00:18:49.224
Calm down! C'mon, calm down, Mamiya!

00:18:49.454 --> 00:18:51.394
Don't touch me, you idiot!

00:18:51.964 --> 00:18:53.554
Mamiya! Whoa!

00:18:58.164 --> 00:19:00.304
Big Brother! That's dangerous!

00:19:00.304 --> 00:19:02.374
Ayumi, you need to come down, too!

00:19:02.374 --> 00:19:04.464
You two need to calm down!

00:19:07.744 --> 00:19:11.014
I know you don't care about me!

00:19:11.014 --> 00:19:13.814
I should just be cursed to death!

00:19:14.084 --> 00:19:16.754
That's not true! That's not true at all!

00:19:16.754 --> 00:19:18.814
You've got the wrong idea, Mamiya!

00:19:19.184 --> 00:19:21.494
How do I have the wrong idea?

00:19:21.494 --> 00:19:25.754
I got your present separately!

00:19:29.594 --> 00:19:32.624
Sorry to make you wait, but Merry Christmas!

00:19:33.934 --> 00:19:38.244
What? So this is a Christmas present for me?

00:19:38.244 --> 00:19:39.544
Can I really have it?

00:19:39.544 --> 00:19:40.974
Of course!

00:19:40.974 --> 00:19:43.774
Come on, let's go down and have
a big party with every...

00:19:43.774 --> 00:19:45.244
Oh?

00:19:59.064 --> 00:20:00.994
H-Haruo!

00:20:08.874 --> 00:20:12.874
Hashire sori yo kaze no you ni
Slide, sleigh, just like the wind

00:20:12.874 --> 00:20:17.514
Yuki no naka wo karuku hayaku
Lightly and speedily in the snow

00:20:17.514 --> 00:20:21.854
Waraigoe wo yuki ni makeba
If you scatter the laughter on the snow

00:20:21.854 --> 00:20:26.024
Akarui hikari no hana ni naru yo
It becomes a bright flower of light

00:20:26.024 --> 00:20:28.724
Hey, jingle bell, jingle bell

00:20:28.724 --> 00:20:30.724
Suzu ga naru
The bells ring

00:20:30.724 --> 00:20:32.764
Suzu no rizumu ni hikari no wa ga mau ooh!
The circles of lights

00:20:32.764 --> 00:20:35.264
Suzu no rizumu ni hikari no wa ga mau ooh!
Dance to the rhythm of the bells, ooh!

00:20:35.264 --> 00:20:37.364
Jingle bell, jingle bell

00:20:37.364 --> 00:20:39.534
Suzu ga naru
The bells ring

00:20:39.534 --> 00:20:43.904
Mori ni hayashi ni hibiki nagara, hey!
It echoes through the trees and the woods, hey!

00:20:59.354 --> 00:21:03.554
Jeez, he worked part-time so he could buy the
Christmas presents and now he's got a cold.

00:21:03.554 --> 00:21:05.824
What do I do with this guy?

00:21:07.294 --> 00:21:10.324
Seriously... He's an idiot.

00:21:19.704 --> 00:21:21.434
Huh? Mamiya?

00:21:26.044 --> 00:21:26.884
Huh?

00:21:26.884 --> 00:21:28.374
What was that noise just now?

00:21:29.084 --> 00:21:30.844
Oh boy...

00:21:44.334 --> 00:21:45.454
Idiot...

00:21:51.244 --> 00:21:52.574
This is not good...

00:21:52.574 --> 00:21:53.664
At this rate...

00:22:10.354 --> 00:22:13.354
MAGIKANO

00:22:19.864 --> 00:22:26.274
This is a secret, but I am a little different

00:22:26.274 --> 00:22:32.484
Do I look ordinary or cute? Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.484 --> 00:22:35.954
I know I'm mellow and mediocre

00:22:35.954 --> 00:22:39.024
But so what? So what?

00:22:39.024 --> 00:22:42.124
But just as I was thinking that

00:22:42.124 --> 00:22:45.494
I got myself mixed up in trouble

00:22:45.494 --> 00:22:48.494
I'm not going to lose, I'm not going to give you up

00:22:48.494 --> 00:22:51.804
Because you are precious to me

00:22:51.804 --> 00:22:58.334
Maybe I should not cast a spell

00:22:59.774 --> 00:23:03.044
I don't want magic to be

00:23:03.044 --> 00:23:06.184
The reason why it's this way

00:23:06.184 --> 00:23:12.724
When it comes to love, it has to be real

00:23:12.724 --> 00:23:19.124
Who are you in love with?

00:23:19.124 --> 00:23:25.304
Everyone is dying to know the answer!

00:23:25.304 --> 00:23:28.604
Seriously, I have to guard you
from the love scramble that is about to begin

00:23:28.604 --> 00:23:30.074
It's a pinch! Here comes my punch!

00:23:37.374 --> 00:23:40.814
Yes! Haruo's magical power has finally awoken!

00:23:40.944 --> 00:23:43.974
The time has come for my curse to be lifted!

00:23:45.754 --> 00:23:50.624
But then Michiru realized what happened to Haruo
and started attacking, trying to make him hers!

00:23:50.624 --> 00:23:52.524
I'll never let that happen!

00:23:54.794 --> 00:23:56.564
Next time on Magikano:

00:23:56.564 --> 00:23:58.694
"Magi? It's Time for Awakening?"

00:23:59.864 --> 00:24:03.564
Let's see... How should I fight this out?
